        },
        {
          "text": " Kasodi keira eporoto loepol loebuni kotoma oyekalu elimokini imalaikan ikanykaarei ebe, “Koloto, kobukokis atanyia akanykaarei nuka adedeŋ naka Edeke toma akwap.”",
