        {
          "text": " Konomoroi ituŋa kamwanis naepol, koinyanakis ekiror loka Edeke, loejai apolou kama ejaas aiticaneta ŋun, kwabo mam apotu kitoronikinos, karaida aitopoloor ŋes.",
