            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koinyanakis Edeke loka akuj kanuka ariebokec, ka idolakec, kwabo mam apotu kitoronikinos kotoma aswamisiokec.",
